{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloobs Adventure Idle is a massive RuneScape-inspired idle RPG built for serious long-term progression.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by RuneScape, Bloobs Adventure Idle is a full idle RPG built around training skills, fighting bosses, and letting your character progress while you do other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skilling and Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train 24 skills \u2014 from Woodcutting, Mining, and Cooking to Magic, Thieving, and BeastMastery. Every skill feeds into the others, creating a layered web of progression where every action strengthens your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push further with the prestige system, resetting skills for permanent bonuses and scaling your account into true endgame power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/51b292545995e97688e9b768e413e0d1.poster.avif?t=1771458855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/51b292545995e97688e9b768e413e0d1.webm?t=1771458855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/51b292545995e97688e9b768e413e0d1.mp4?t=1771458855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat and Equipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is automated \u2014 but power is earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your build, craft stronger equipment, and challenge bosses designed to test your stats and gear. Each victory unlocks tougher encounters, better rewards, and rare unique drops that can redefine your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is constant. Power is scalable. The climb never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/b6ca0bebf9d2b28b244b4f9a855a422d.poster.avif?t=1771458855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/b6ca0bebf9d2b28b244b4f9a855a422d.webm?t=1771458855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/b6ca0bebf9d2b28b244b4f9a855a422d.mp4?t=1771458855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Codex, Beastiary, Thief\u2019s Log, Item Compendium, Achievements, and Souldex</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloobs rewards players who love depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track every enemy in the Beastiary, discover rare loot in the Thief\u2019s Log, and catalog your progress in the Item Compendium. Dive into the Souldex \u2014 a collection of over 500 souls to unlock, each with unique variations and bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you chase completion or focus purely on power progression, there\u2019s always another milestone waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/3423f2faa7e78fe105e0279f18b020df.poster.avif?t=1771458855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/3423f2faa7e78fe105e0279f18b020df.webm?t=1771458855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/3423f2faa7e78fe105e0279f18b020df.mp4?t=1771458855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Banked Time System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle on your schedule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloobs stores up to 96 hours of offline time, giving you a powerful reserve of saved progress. Spend that banked time to accelerate the entire game \u2014 pushing skills, combat, and crafting forward at high speed whenever you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t just idle. You decide when the pace increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloobs Adventure Idle combines familiar RuneScape-inspired skilling with layered systems designed for long-term progression. Prestige, skill synergy, and exploration come together in a steady loop that continues to grow with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"PLAYED BLOOBS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2942780/688a5b3090eb420efe72530a1ee2127301779048.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Woodcutter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2942780/3558cb1950e0be803e9a94038ec1e27ea66907b2.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Fisher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2942780/602a9032c9808d3feb90cb25b0331cb4016bbd1b.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Forager","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2942780/b5baafd6cfe502705eb76d460e6c0c3067b71585.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Attack Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2942780/cb0d82f6afa83bc143a65eeda8b509e1aefba829.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Mining Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2942780/86c8173385be5be06e6a7eceb35672d858913662.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Smithing Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2942780/b45289c1184fe4711d853bc08fa2a62cb6d4716a.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Cooking Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2942780/364e30fa848191df2ee5e8082872fa539a41484e.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Firemaking Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2942780/cf6e0fbefb1f14562befbf49dc065f7d0a3e621d.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Dexterity Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2942780/0cf054f069b49ef730fda17b93d6a882af57f297.jpg"}],"total":235},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2942780?t=1771458855","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2942780?t=1771458855","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/9ef77881a5ed0cff41ed7d369fc507f310073072/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771458855","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/9ef77881a5ed0cff41ed7d369fc507f310073072/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771458855","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3053820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloobs Adventure Idle is a massive RuneScape-inspired idle RPG built for serious long-term progression.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by RuneScape, Bloobs Adventure Idle is a full idle RPG built around training skills, fighting bosses, and letting your character progress while you do other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skilling and Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train 24 skills \u2014 from Woodcutting, Mining, and Cooking to Magic, Thieving, and BeastMastery. Every skill feeds into the others, creating a layered web of progression where every action strengthens your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push further with the prestige system, resetting skills for permanent bonuses and scaling your account into true endgame power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/51b292545995e97688e9b768e413e0d1.poster.avif?t=1771458855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/51b292545995e97688e9b768e413e0d1.webm?t=1771458855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/51b292545995e97688e9b768e413e0d1.mp4?t=1771458855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat and Equipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is automated \u2014 but power is earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your build, craft stronger equipment, and challenge bosses designed to test your stats and gear. Each victory unlocks tougher encounters, better rewards, and rare unique drops that can redefine your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is constant. Power is scalable. The climb never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/b6ca0bebf9d2b28b244b4f9a855a422d.poster.avif?t=1771458855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/b6ca0bebf9d2b28b244b4f9a855a422d.webm?t=1771458855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942780/extras/b6ca0bebf9d2b28b244b4